# .claude/ is NOT tracked — the working set (CLAUDE.md, skills, agents, hooks,
# settings.json) is handed to new developers by copy, not by clone.
# See document/getting-started/onboarding.md §4 for what to copy and what must
# never leave the machine (CV/, presentation/, settings.local.json).
# NOTE: .gitignore has no inline comments — never append "# ..." after a pattern.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.mcp.json

**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# workflow_settings.yaml is intentionally NOT listed here: it is already tracked,
